From 5c8b078152a81c97d4972743c9371de5c68bb9b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Goose contributors <goose@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:38:28 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Support typed builders and multiple results across the native
 interface

Allow native callees to append flat elements to Goose builders, and expose
Goose export results through C return values, output pointers and scratch
builders. Include builder helpers in both public and embedded runtimes.
Report the native value ABI and independently named capabilities.
